# TFIXU r1 #4: a button held across a view change belongs to the view it was pressed in. SEL held
# in LIVE and a long PLAY to leave starts no clear on arrival in STUDIO (studio_tick restarted the
# SEL hold from down_t). Before the fix set_view did not mark the held buttons used, so the cursor
# clip was cleared (the final expect got 0).
wait 300
tap SEQ
tap HOME
wait 1400
expect clipused0 1                  # the boot song's first clip is loaded
press PLAY
wait 700
release PLAY
wait 50
expect mode 1                       # in LIVE
press SEL
wait 100
press PLAY                          # long press: leave LIVE with SEL still held
wait 700
release PLAY
wait 50
expect mode 0                       # back in STUDIO
wait 1800                           # past the 250 ms SEL clear ring and the 1.5 s clear
release SEL
wait 100
expect clipused0 1                  # still loaded: no clear started on arrival
